## 3. `tools/canvas/scripts/push-bd.sh` (~30 lines)

Shell script that parses BD text output and pushes to AgentPing. BD does NOT have --format json, it outputs text like:
```
○ lev-w7sm [● P0] [epic] - Core Runtime Build (blocks: lev-w7sm.1, lev-w7sm.2)
◐ lev-w7sm.1 [● P1] [task] - Implement config loader (blocked by: lev-w7sm)
```

Status symbols: ○ = open, ◐ = in_progress, ● = closed

Script should:
1. Run `bd list 2>/dev/null` and capture output
2. Parse each line with awk/sed into JSON cards array
3. Build a JSON payload with componentType "kanban" and the cards
4. POST to AgentPing API

```bash
#!/usr/bin/env bash
# push-bd.sh — Export BD state to Canvas via AgentPing
set -euo pipefail

API_URL="${AGENTPING_URL:-http://localhost:7890}"

# Parse BD text output into JSON cards
bd_to_json() {
  bd list 2>/dev/null | while IFS= read -r line; do
    # Skip empty lines
    [[ -z "$line" ]] && continue

    # Determine status from symbol
    status="open"
    [[ "$line" == ◐* ]] && status="in_progress"
    [[ "$line" == ●* ]] && status="closed"

    # Extract fields using regex-like parsing
    id=$(echo "$line" | sed -E 's/^[○◐●] ([^ ]+).*/\1/')
    priority=$(echo "$line" | sed -E 's/.*\[● (P[0-3])\].*/\1/' | grep -E '^P[0-3]$' || echo "P3")
    type=$(echo "$line" | sed -E 's/.*\[(epic|task|bug)\].*/\1/' | grep -E '^(epic|task|bug)$' || echo "task")
    title=$(echo "$line" | sed -E 's/.*\] - (.*?)( \(.*)?$/\1/')

    # Output JSON object (one per line)
    printf '{"id":"%s","title":"%s","column":"%s","priority":"%s","type":"%s"}' \
      "$id" "$title" "$status" "$priority" "$type"
    echo ","
  done
}

# Build cards JSON array
CARDS="[$(bd_to_json | sed '$ s/,$//' | tr -d '\n')]"

# Push to AgentPing
curl -s -X POST "${API_URL}/api/v1/pings" \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d "{
    \"type\": \"canvas_interaction\",
    \"title\": \"BD Dashboard\",
    \"message\": \"Current BD epics and tasks\",
    \"priority\": \"medium\",
    \"payload\": {
      \"type\": \"canvas_interaction\",
      \"action\": \"render\",
      \"componentType\": \"kanban\",
      \"props\": {
        \"columns\": [\"open\", \"in_progress\", \"blocked\", \"closed\"],
        \"cards\": $CARDS
      }
    }
  }"

echo ""
echo "✓ BD state pushed to Canvas"
```

Make push-bd.sh executable with chmod +x.

